# Beast 3.0 Workflow Automation Division

The Workflow Automation Division serves as the background execution engine of the Beast 3.0 framework, ensuring timed tasks, data syncs, and multi-division pipelines execute seamlessly without manual intervention.

## Mission

Automate routine governance, treasury syncs, audit checks, and telemetry reports through resilient event-driven scheduling.

## Core Responsibilities

- Scheduled Cron Job Management
- Multi-Division Task Pipeline Orchestration
- Event-Driven Trigger Routing
- Failure Recovery & Job Retries

## Connected Systems

- System Orchestrator (`div-21-system-orchestrator`)
- Judicial & Audit Division (`div-03-judicial`)
- Treasury & Revenue Division (`beast3-treasury-revenue`)
- Analytics & Telemetry Division (`beast3-analytics`)

## Status

Development
